notes = "Automatic BIOS selection checks ROM contents, regardless of filename extension.|Region Check Bypass defaults to Enabled and requires a matching external patch.|Provide working dongles in system/pcsx2x6/memcards; game saves use the save directory.|System BIOS companion files, dongles and caches can be written during emulation.|Folder presence does not validate BIOS contents. See the included README and known issues."
description = "Experimental PCSX2x6 libretro core for NAMCO System 246 and System 256 arcade games. Loads .acgame manifests, renders with Vulkan (default) or Direct3D 11 and hands each frame to the frontend as a GPU image, and delivers stereo audio. Vulkan requires a frontend Vulkan video driver with context negotiation v2; Direct3D 11 requires a frontend D3D11 video driver. There is no software video fallback. Supports two-player JVS fighting controls, basic digital drum inputs and in-memory save states for the same core build, content and key settings; rewind, run-ahead and netplay are not supported."
